Here is my patch against 2.6.15-at91 (including at91 patch from
http://maxim.org.za/AT91RM9200/2.6)
My patch include the ipipe patch found in xenomai 2.1.0 for ARM
architecture + my own modification and tests (sorry, lots of poor code for
debuging purpose).
I've changed the asm idle function specific to arm920 to disable use of
interrupt wakeup, just to see the behavior, but this is not the normal way
of running...

I will try to clear my code soon to produce a more comprehensive patch...
Here is a first watch.

Regards

Yann

(See attached file: 2.6.15-at91-ipipe-modified.patch.bz2)

